sion-making, highlighting both theoretical foundations and real-world applications such as hedging strategies that reduce transaction costs and improve risk management.</p>\n<p><a href=\"../../resources/mit18_642_f24_lec23_pdf/index.html\">Introduction to Machine Learning Slides (PDF)</a></p>\n",
